", "text_resource": {"embeddings": null, "text": "n Sensors (TPS). These two values must be within a calibrated value of each other. The ECM also monitors each individual circuit of the TPSs, and of the PPSs to verify proper operation (the Pedal Position Sensor reads the degree of movement of the Throttle-Shift Control from 0 degrees at locked neutral, to 120 degrees at Wide Open Throttle [WOT]).", "path": null, "url": null, "mimetype": null}, "image_resource": null, "audio_resource": null, "video_resource": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

