", "text_resource": {"embeddings": null, "text": "NOTE: This DTC will not set if all of the following conditions are present: The throttle actuator motor circuit is OPEN, the ignition is on, the throttle plate is in the spring loaded rest position, the Throttle-Shift Control (T-SC) is in the locked-neutral (idle) position, and the engine is not started. The code will set if the engine is then started, or if the T-SC is moved, or if the throttle plate is moved within 10 seconds of turning the ignition on.
", "path": null, "url": null, "mimetype": null}, "image_resource": null, "audio_resource": null, "video_resource": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "Document", "text": "NOTE: This DTC will not set if all of the following conditions are present: The throttle actuator motor circuit is OPEN, the ignition is on, the throttle plate is in the spring loaded rest position, the Throttle-Shift Control (T-SC) is in the locked-neutral (idle) position, and the engine is not started. The code will set if the engine is then started, or if the T-SC is moved, or if the throttle plate is moved within 10 seconds of turning the ignition on.
"}

